            "start_line": 24,
            "end_line": 25,
            "line_count": 2,
            "preview": "// Adjust it to the Julian equivalent of ISO date 2012-07-06. JulianDate adjusted = startingPoint.with(LocalDate.of(2012, 7, 6));"
